    {
      "text": "Contents\n1. Variation Study\n2. Measurement System\n3. Control Plan\n4. Capability Review",
      "headings": []
    },
    {
      "text": "1 Variation Study\n1.1 Evidence Inputs\nSix Sigma teams align work to six sigma quality control goals and record evidence before advancing the work item.\n• Review the signal before changing the plan\n• Keep ownership visible across handoffs\nStage Evidence Owner\nFrame Baseline Lead\nTest Outcome Team\nLearn Decision Sponsor",
      "headings": [
