          "level": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "2 Measurement System\n2.1 Decision Rights\nThe Six Sigma method uses measurement system to make the next decision observable and reversible.\nTeams capture context, compare evidence, and assign a named owner for the next review.\nControl Measure Escalation\nGate 1 Metric 1 Owner 1\nGate 2 Metric 2 Owner 2\nGate 3 Metric 3 Owner 3\nGate 4 Metric 4 Owner 4\nGate 5 Metric 5 Owner 5",
